  <item>
    <title>把身体交给土地，把精神交给信仰 —— 藏地意境</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ae9f743c96c8942ec16d8d5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ae9f743c96c8942ec16d8d5</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 15:06:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a></span><strong><span>10 天重走唐蕃古道</span></strong><span>：西宁进、拉萨出，冬游西藏 A 级景区全免票</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="345">05:45</a></span><strong><span>期待落空</span></strong><span>：语言不通 + 走马观花，没能深入藏地；藏传佛教 "左脑进右脑出"</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="345">05:45</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">09:30</a></span><strong><span>《水乳大地》与盐井往事</span></strong><span>："把身体交给土地，把精神交给信仰"，现代人羡慕的生活方式</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">09:30</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="680">11:20</a></span><strong><span>高反自救手册</span></strong><span>：可乐红牛葡萄糖；高反其实是大脑加工出来的恐惧，脑身分离</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="680">11:20</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a></span><strong><span>拉萨 vs 日喀则</span></strong><span>：更喜欢像老西藏的日喀则</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a></span><strong><span>购物与写真</span></strong><span>：八廓商贸中心比八廓街便宜 3 倍、</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1350">22:30</a></span><strong><span>旅行到底有什么意义</span></strong><span>：三宫九宫人天生在路上；水星线过阿勒泰和日喀则</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1350">22:30</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1854">30:54</a></span><strong><span>扎心收尾</span></strong><span>：流经但没有击中；输入型爱好会麻木，要培养输出型爱好；羡慕没见过世面的自己</span></p><p></p><p><span>拉萨进的货 （部分）</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk9FvwbF_NqRj_1zquezEbRkiG4I.jpg"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkMwJUMkadvg01CP9Kgedhin-SYq.jpg"><p><span>扎什伦布寺</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn6n8ZErMMUw8mSjm3D00pHSprOX.jpg"><p><span>纳木措</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtA45dA1QqIUTWOzmZStOXzPS_sn.jpg"><p><span>萨普神山</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpqJiIJCkwAyKY3lEUcJKtbIFiLc.jpg"><p><span>布加冰川</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkkS0dGfvjmnqr-t1VSWJMZ7gDdT.jpg"><p><span>孜珠寺对面</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsoEXCvzycP-BKNV0bQ3J1HkZ3jy.jpg"><p><span>布托湖</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg2Q5x6iPnkgmoCAu2XgZP2VTvyV.jpg"><p><span>孜珠寺对面</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FndyfoA6TOzILgGBEoZEdmQY6IQb.jpg"><p><span>尕尔寺对面</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpvAsfe10fzok3cDjpukDx26v-GV.jpg"><p><span>青海湖</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgJlotLXnCYUgOwc713up-9ogNxV.jpg"><p><span>阿尼玛卿神山</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
