    <title>所有的逆行，都是给你一次回头检视的机会</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ae751aa97726cd4675b1773</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ae751aa97726cd4675b1773</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 14:56:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span></strong><strong><span> </span></strong><span>11 月星象总览</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="137">02:17</a></span></strong><span>金星天蝎逆行典型表现：情感金钱纠缠、想动脸、清理旧关系、母系议题</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="580">09:40</a></span></strong><span>金星天蝎逆行的 8 年周期（2010/2018 对照）+ 水逆翻旧账 + 逆回天秤进入关系修复期</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1148">19:08</a></span></strong><span>唐蕃古道进藏：西宁→玉树→拉萨，偏爱青海日喀则，吐槽拉萨商业化</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1308">21:48</a></span></strong><span>进藏奇遇：全程无高反（恐惧是大脑假象）、避开那曲地震封路、推荐乃加玛神山转山</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1971">32:51</a></span></strong><span>西北藏地饮食见闻：藏餐与内蒙奶食相通、手工酸奶最满意 + 直播互动</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2329">38:49</a></span></strong><span>占星答疑 新手盘设置：回归黄道 + 普拉希德制默认即可</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2377">39:37</a></span></strong><span>占星答疑 梦到旧人怎么办：睡前心理暗示 + 睁眼立即闭眼回溯</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2430">40:30</a></span></strong><span>金逆的本质：查漏补缺、直面遗留问题与执念</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2518">41:58</a></span></strong><span>占星答疑 宫位制：整宫 / 分宫无统一标准，新手不必纠结</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2709">45:09</a></span></strong><span>星象行运的真正意义：回看成长螺旋，别被天象束缚、遵从本心</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2892">48:12</a></span></strong><span>探索自我 &gt; 精准预测：人本质混沌，保持对自己的好奇</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3039">50:39</a></span></strong><span>长征胜利 90 周年感悟：实践论 / 矛盾论才是成事的底层方法论</span></p>]]></description>
